    why: "So a pie is not used for a trend.",
    prior: "The listener is clear. The shape of the insight picks the picture, before you open a tool.",
    see: "Trend is over time. Difference is between groups. Share is part of one whole. Outlier is a point apart from the group. Together means two things move together, which is not yet a cause. “Forms and spend rise together” is together. It is not “spend causes forms”. C2 already said moving together is not a cause.",
