    precise: "These five shapes pick the picture. They do not replace a test. An outlier can be a typo, the same way a range is dragged by one extreme. Together is a descriptive correlation, not a causal coefficient. Get the shape wrong and you get the picture wrong, and the listener will remember the picture.",
