    use: ["Write the objective in one sentence: maximize what, or minimize what.", "List the numbers you are actually allowed to choose.", "If a “variable” is only a formula of other variables, it is not a variable."],
    precise: "Mix up the objective and the decision variables and there is nothing left to solve: you typed the answer yourself. A constraint is also not the objective. “Don't exceed the budget” is a limit. “Profit” might be the objective. Both in one cell is a broken model.",
    insight: "If you can type in the objective cell, the model is not built yet.",
