    precise: "This session in the syllabus is a demonstration. It does not hand you a case set. Treating the demo as an evaluation is the same mistake as accuracy on a crowded class: a pretty number, the wrong job. Don't invent a transcript. Don't invent an accuracy rate for the demonstration.",
